  "_comment": "D74 time-of-day presets. A preset MODULATES the active zone's look, it never replaces it: colours lerp from the zone's own value by their *_weight, energies/fog scale by their *_mult, ground_mult multiplies the zone's ground tints. midday is the identity (all weights 0, all mults 1) = today's look. Sun angle is explicit (sun_elevation/sun_azimuth, deg; azimuth from north clockwise) via sun.gd's override_angles, so the season no longer decides the look. The lead tunes these from tools/shots/time_shots.tscn.",
